SUMMARY:Lord Bishop Rocks (USA) + Support
DESCRIPTION:LORD BISHOP ROCKS! \nPrepare yourself for a wall of thunderous riffs\, deep grooves\, soaring vocals\, and electrifying solos. LORD BISHOP ROCKS delivers a powerful blend of hard rock\, funk\, blues\, and soul that hits with incredible force while staying deeply musical. Every song is packed with passion\, raw energy\, and world-class musicianship that pulls you in from the very first note. \nThis isn’t just music you hear—it’s music you feel. If you love big guitar sounds\, crushing rhythms\, and performances that ignite the crowd\, this is the show you’ve been waiting for. \n  \nwww.lordbishoprocks.com \nhttps://open.spotify.com/track/59hMSGOOqtLvAlLYi72Zzq?autoplay_ok=1 \n+ Support \nTickets: https://bar.rareguitar.de/tickets
