SUMMARY:Ultra World - Industrial Electro Punk
DESCRIPTION:Ultra World is the soundtrack to a burning world. The female-fronted power trio sounds like what you’d get if Nine Inch Nails and The Prodigy had a furious daughter. \nThe band from Luxembourg combines crushing electronic beats\, live instruments\, and an unapologetic punk attitude. Blending industrial\, EBM\, electro-punk and dance floor energy. \nUltra World has performed at clubs and major national festivals\, including E-Lake and Francofolies\, but also has brought its audiovisual live show to international stages in countries such as Germany\, Czech Republic and Portugal. \nFor fans of Nine Inch Nails\, The Prodigy\, Sextile\, Pixel Grip\, Marilyn Manson and Carpenter Brut.
URL:https://bar.rareguitar.de/event/ultra-world-industrial-electro-punk
LOCATION:Rare Guitar\, Hafenstraße 64\, Münster\, 48153\, Deutschland
CATEGORIES:Konzert
